-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Finlay</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">The Oak Depot</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$565,565</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Unknown</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Update_Log/Version_1.40.0\" title=\"Update Log/Version 1.40.0\">v1.40.0</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<blockquote><p><i>Esp hstdapcd. . . Espj'cp pgpcjhspcp. . . Zywj l dstqe ty etxp xlj cpgplw hspy esp ecfp xplytyr htww dszh. . .</i></p></blockquote>\n<p>The <b>Pebble of Truth</b> is an item purchasable from <a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">The Oak Depot</a> for $565,656.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\">Details</span></h2>\n<p>The Pebble of Truth is an intentionally cryptic item. The description is ciphertext, and the Pebble emits a quiet whispering sound.\n</p><p>For those who wish to try to solve the mystery themselves, the rest of the details will be hidden in a spoiler section:\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"width:100%;\">  \n<dl><dd><b>⚠ WARNING! This section contains spoilers. Read at your own discretion.</b></dd></dl>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\">\n<p>The description of the Pebble of Truth is encrypted using a Caesar cipher, rotated 11 positions to the right. The actual description is as follows:\n</p>\n<blockquote><p><i>The whispers. . . They're everywhere. . . Only a shift in time may reveal when the true meaning will show. . .</i></p></blockquote>\n<p>( Edit: The clue is the words 'shift in time'. The duck shrine turns baby ducks into adult ducks which means it shifts time. )\n</p><p>While the description nor the whispers provide any hints as to where to take the Pebble of Truth, if taken to the <a href=\"/wiki/Duck_Shrine\" title=\"Duck Shrine\">Duck Shrine</a> beneath the short arch bridge in <a href=\"/wiki/Finlay_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Finlay Island\">Finlay</a>. The Duck Shrine emits the same whispers as the Pebble of Truth does. Placing the Pebble or <a href=\"/wiki/Glass_Ducky\" title=\"Glass Ducky\">Adult Glass Ducky</a> there causes the shrine to begin charging up before letting out a massive explosion of energy, turning the Shrine's light red. The Pebble of Truth will not be consumed. The altar cannot be activated again by any other Pebble of Truth, but the same Pebble of Truth can be used to activate shrines in servers where it has not been activated.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-center show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frame\" style=\"width: 666px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/5e/Idk.png/revision/latest?cb=20231117150557\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"After placing it\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/5e/Idk.png/revision/latest?cb=20231117150557\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"666\" height=\"478\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Idk.png\" data-image-key=\"Idk.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Idk.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">After placing it</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163452\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.043 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.051 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 57/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 53/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 37/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.009/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019515/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   42.455      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   42.455      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:1897-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903163452 and revision id 20590. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","categories":[],"links":[{"title":"The Oak Depot","exists":true},{"title":"Update Log/Version 1.40.0","exists":true},{"title":"Duck Shrine","exists":true},{"title":"Finlay Island","exists":true},{"title":"Glass Ducky","exists":true}],"images":["Pebble_of_Truth.png","Idk.png"]}
